  "descriptionParagraphs": [
    "Anantara Dhigu Maldives is a tropical haven in the Indian Ocean. Indulge in barefoot sophistication in a tropical haven that caters to the entire family. This is a great place to build an unforgettable vacation, with a range of luxurious accommodations offering breathtaking views and private pools. For easy fun, try a variety of cuisines, relax with soothing spa treatments, and explore the nearby lagoon.",
    "The 110 villas and suites at Anantara Maldives offer a variety of room sizes, with some perched above the water and others nestled on unspoiled sands. Choose from sunrise or sunset views, or a villa with your own private pool."
